@startuml class
title SysPulse — Class Diagram

class CpuTimes {
  +long long user
  +long long nice
  +long long system
  +long long idle
  +long long iowait
  +long long irq
  +long long softirq
  +long long steal
  +total(): long long
  +active(): long long
}

class MemInfo {
  +long long totalKb
  +long long availableKb
}

class SharedState {
  -mutex stateMutex
  -double cpuPercent
  -double memPercent
  -double cpuThreshold
  -bool alertActive
  +getStatus(): string
  +setThreshold(value: double)
}

class MonitorThread {
  +run()
  -readCpuTimes(): CpuTimes
  -readMemInfo(): MemInfo
  -computeCpuPercent(): double
  -computeMemPercent(): double
}

class SocketServer {
  -int serverFd
  +run()
  -handleCommand(cmd: string): string
  -acceptClient()
}

class SyspulseCtl {
  +main(argc, argv): int
  -sendCommand(cmd: string): string
}

MonitorThread ..> CpuTimes : reads
MonitorThread ..> MemInfo : reads
MonitorThread --> SharedState : updates
SocketServer --> SharedState : reads/updates
SyspulseCtl --> SocketServer : connects via\nUNIX socket

@enduml